msgstr "Karakterverschillen"

#: faq/font_sample.php:44
msgid ""
"Below are some examples of similar looking characters that are easier to "
"distinguish in DP Sans Mono than in other fonts, in this case your default "
"browser monospace font."
msgstr ""
