#: faq/pophelp/prefs/prefs_pophelp.inc:140
msgid "Watching Project Threads"
msgstr "Projectdiscussies volgen"

#: faq/pophelp/prefs/prefs_pophelp.inc:142
msgid ""
"<p>This setting determines if you will be automatically signed up for\n"
"email notifications when a forum thread is created for one of your projects."
"</p>\n"
"<p>Changing this setting only applies to forum threads created in the "
"future.\n"
"If you wish to change the notification on existing forum threads, you will "
"need to do so manually.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Met deze instelling bepaal je of je automatisch wordt aangemeld voor\n"
"e-mailmeldingen wanneer er een forumdiscussie wordt aangemaakt voor een van "
