#: quiz/generic/quiz_page.inc:503
msgid "You need to delete one or more lines at the end of your text."
msgstr "Sie müssen eine oder mehrere Zeilen am Ende Ihres Textes löschen."

#: quiz/generic/quiz_page.inc:511
msgid ""
"The text you submitted is correct, as far as it goes, but it is missing one "
