#: quiz/generic/wizard/checks.php:214
msgid "Check for forbidden text"
msgstr "Auf verbotenen Text prüfen"

#: quiz/generic/wizard/checks.php:216 quiz/generic/wizard/checks.php:242
msgid ""
"This will look if at least one of the strings you give here does occur in "
"the text."
msgstr ""

#: quiz/generic/wizard/checks.php:231 quiz/generic/wizard/checks.php:257
msgid ""
"Should you need more than 10 texts being searched simultaneously you'll have "
"to edit the final file."
msgstr ""

#: quiz/generic/wizard/checks.php:233 quiz/generic/wizard/checks.php:259
